    "bookid": 63,
    "chapterId": 19,
    "fileId": 32082,
    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Paediatric cutaneous mastocytosis (polymorphic maculopapular cutaneous mastocytosis)",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The epidermis shows elongated rete ridges and pronounced hyperpigmentation; pale-staining histiocytoid cells infiltrate the upper dermis (&lt;&lt;32082&gt;&gt;). Immunohistochemistry for tryptase identifies these cells as mast cells (&lt;&lt;32083&gt;&gt;).",
    "source": "Isabel Colmenero",
